XT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea282-df82-11ee-a03b-2982f2961a63\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec924-df82-11ee-a03b-cf71c7448558\">문의 0건</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea284-df82-11ee-a03b-8f6d10b57e76\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec925-df82-11ee-a03b-df29e3673049\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea286-df82-11ee-a03b-6ff6f1d183de\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec926-df82-11ee-a03b-bbe498574754\">C형태의 글 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea288-df82-11ee-a03b-67e18577fb86\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec927-df82-11ee-a03b-35c12e0b8e3b\">톡톡 100건 전송 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea28a-df82-11ee-a03b-296c373f11d2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec928-df82-11ee-a03b-b907d697dc73\">읽음 4건 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea28c-df82-11ee-a03b-6f6eb61aefe1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec929-df82-11ee-a03b-c9cde911440d\">문의 1건</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec92a-df82-11ee-a03b-29c67d6a6f37\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e0a8b1e6-ce45-4547-a4c6-48ca707b1aae\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec92b-df82-11ee-a03b-e33ccec6f286\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea28f-df82-11ee-a03b-b3b3ce85b165\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec92c-df82-11ee-a03b-f5d3255cc170\">이렇게 데이터을 쌓아놓고 무슨 글이 &#x27;글&#x27;자체 효과가 있는지 보는거죠.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea291-df82-11ee-a03b-7190a0e24c17\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec92d-df82-11ee-a03b-cfea92de5d68\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea293-df82-11ee-a03b-67d6adfcd28c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec92e-df82-11ee-a03b-d7950244bdfb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea295-df82-11ee-a03b-8fdd432896b4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec92f-df82-11ee-a03b-b53622258c3f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea297-df82-11ee-a03b-5bd055da7009\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec930-df82-11ee-a03b-3171f17bf87a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea299-df82-11ee-a03b-d3e34ae86022\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec931-df82-11ee-a03b-418505ed5d18\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea29b-df82-11ee-a03b-f9887d02f50f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec932-df82-11ee-a03b-f5451e64547b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea29d-df82-11ee-a03b-ff71ddcb0c75\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec933-df82-11ee-a03b-23fe940c4b3c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea29f-df82-11ee-a03b-17bdc086905e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec934-df82-11ee-a03b-df1e6c751e9c\">직장을 다니던 분들은 이 과정이 익숙하지 않을수 있습니다. 직장에서는 성과로만 평가를 하니까요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea2a1-df82-11ee-a03b-b744b8fd4eed\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec935-df82-11ee-a03b-59364774fb6a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea2a3-df82-11ee-a03b-9951ee32e694\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec936-df82-11ee-a03b-abe95f9b9bae\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea2a5-df82-11ee-a03b-cbf407408b93\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec937-df82-11ee-a03b-5d88bcc40de8\">제가 가르치던 아이들에게도 자주 하던 말인데요. 진짜 시험은 사실 수능 한번입니다. 수능을 제외한 모든 시험은 너를 평가하고자 하는게 아니고, 스스로 뭘 모르는지 알기 위함이라구요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea2a7-df82-11ee-a03b-d568628f8f7c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec938-df82-11ee-a03b-d99f8aa2a43e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea2a9-df82-11ee-a03b-85cf2382104b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec939-df82-11ee-a03b-f727c10a0444\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea2ab-df82-11ee-a03b-8190e587f49f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec93a-df82-11ee-a03b-71a8adb810b1\">&quot;영업했어요&quot;게시판에 이제 많은 분들이 영업하고 계시는데요. 영업했어요 게시판에 영업한 내용을 적으라고 말씀드리는 이유도 오답노트를 해보셨으면 하는 마음에서 였습니다 :)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea2ad-df82-11ee-a03b-3b00dfadf7ad\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cec93b-df82-11ee-a03b-ef7f3d5c3500\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea2af-df82-11ee-a03b-0fc31b20220d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cef04c-df82-11ee-a03b-afd6ad2613cc\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea2b1-df82-11ee-a03b-4ffac51124f9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cef04d-df82-11ee-a03b-955392f0d81c\">그럼 오늘도 영업하는 모든 분들 화이팅입니다!</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64cea2b3-df82-11ee-a03b-41208b6385e0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-64cef04e-df82-11ee-a03b-59e1bb647be0\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>    </div>\n</div>\n",
